<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu rises to year high in heavy trade.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu rises to year high in heavy trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Fujitsu Ltd rose to their highest level for a year in heavy trade on Tuesday, as the major computer maker attracted investors seeking global blue-chip issues, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price gained 30 yen to 1,220 yen at 0428 GMT, its highest since January 5 last year.</p>
<p>Volume was about 10.18 million shares, making it the most active trade on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
